  "details": "Red Hat Lightwell has released ch.qos.logback:logback-classic 1.2.11.rhlw-00001 with a backported security fix.\n\nCVE-2023-6378: A serialization vulnerability in logback receiver component part of \nlogback version 1.4.11 allows an attacker to mount a Denial-Of-Service \nattack by sending poisoned data.\n\nThis patched artifact is a drop-in replacement for ch.qos.logback:logback-classic 1.2.11 from Maven Central.",
